{{GM|$Craft|$Clothes & Equipment|$Tools|$Axes|$Butcher's Cleaver}}

Armor penetration: 20 %

Increases butchering speed. And also speeds up "slaughter" action

==Quality==

* [[{{PAGENAME}}]] Quality = <math>\frac{\frac{_{q}WroughtIron+ _{q}Wood+ _{q}Glue}{3} *  9 + {_{q}Anvil* 4 + _{q}Smithy's Hammer}* 3}{16}</math> and is [[softcap|softcapped]] by <math>\sqrt[2]{Strength *Smithing}</math>


* Damage scales with strength and weapon quality using the following formula: <math>Damage = 45*\sqrt{\sqrt{Strength*{q}Cleaver}/10}</math>.

==Notes==

Since it is considered an "axe" you can use it to chop trees and split woodblocks. You can even [[Mining|mine]] with it!

Block yield from logs seems to be equivalent to [[Stone Axe]], not [[Metal Axe|Metal]] or [[Woodsman's Axe|Woodman's]].

